      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "USE OF PROCEEDS We estimate that net proceeds to us from this offering will be approximately $\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007million from the sale of the notes in this offering (after deducting the underwriting discounts and our estimated offering expenses). We intend to use the net proceeds from the sale of notes in this offering for general corporate purposes, including: (i)\u00a0funding the redemption or repayment at maturity of all the $550\u00a0million aggregate principal amount of our 3.85% Senior Notes due December\u00a015, 2026 (approximately $535\u00a0million of which was issued by us and approximately $15\u00a0million of which was issued by our subsidiary, L3); and (ii)\u00a0together with cash on hand, funding a portion of the redemption or repayment at maturity of the $1,250\u00a0million aggregate principal amount of our 5.40% Notes due January\u00a015, 2027, and in each case, to pay any premium and accrued and unpaid interest in respect th",
